00:11:08.560 --> 00:11:11.060
If this path is obstructed...

00:11:11.060 --> 00:11:12.520
What would happen?

00:11:12.520 --> 00:11:15.810
We wouldn't be able to reach the heart,

00:11:15.810 --> 00:11:18.560
and we wouldn't be able to deliver
any oxygen or nutrients, either.

00:11:18.560 --> 00:11:21.520
What? Doesn't that mean that...

00:11:23.100 --> 00:11:25.150
It won't do any good to think about it.

00:11:25.150 --> 00:11:27.980
Right now, let's just do what we can.

00:11:35.900 --> 00:11:37.480
Did someone drop this?

00:11:49.980 --> 00:11:52.770
Wh-What's going on?

00:11:52.770 --> 00:11:54.940
Hey, you guys...

00:11:54.940 --> 00:11:56.270
What in the world happened?

00:11:56.270 --> 00:11:58.020
The plaque ruptured.

00:11:58.020 --> 00:11:59.400
The plaque?

00:11:59.400 --> 00:12:02.560
The Platelets are forming a clot now...

00:12:02.560 --> 00:12:04.060
...but as you can see,

00:12:04.060 --> 00:12:07.270
the pathway's so narrow now,
it's turning into a traffic jam.

00:12:07.270 --> 00:12:08.810
Is this...

00:12:08.810 --> 00:12:10.440
...a blood clot?

00:12:11.520 --> 00:12:13.060
Blood Clot.

00:12:13.060 --> 00:12:16.400
Blood that clumps inside the blood vessels.

00:12:16.400 --> 00:12:20.940
Formed when the vessel walls
are injured or inflamed.

00:12:20.940 --> 00:12:26.230
As they block blood flow,
they can lead to all kinds of diseases.

00:12:27.520 --> 00:12:30.900
It's just like that pulmonary embolism.

00:12:35.690 --> 00:12:36.770
Hey, you there!

00:12:36.770 --> 00:12:38.310
Y-Yes?

00:12:38.310 --> 00:12:42.270
Don't get any closer!
Do you want to end up like that?

00:12:42.270 --> 00:12:44.440
I-I'm sorry!

00:12:44.440 --> 00:12:45.850
We'll be careful as we move on.

00:12:45.850 --> 00:12:48.980
W-We're moving on?
Through a place like this?

00:12:48.980 --> 00:12:52.480
It'll be all right. Just follow me.

00:12:57.060 --> 00:13:00.400
How are the coronary artery
plaque ruptures looking?

00:13:00.400 --> 00:13:04.310
The Platelets are repairing them now,

00:13:04.310 --> 00:13:08.190
but the vessels have narrowed,
so now the blood pressure is rising.

00:13:08.190 --> 00:13:09.060
What?

00:13:09.060 --> 00:13:12.100
We're seeing signs of angina.

00:13:12.100 --> 00:13:15.600
Looks like there's just enough room
for the Red Blood Cells to pass through, but...

00:13:16.770 --> 00:13:20.900
So, we've managed to avoid
the worst case scenario, but...

00:13:20.900 --> 00:13:25.400
...this means that there's still the risk
of a secondary disaster.

00:13:26.690 --> 00:13:28.810
It looks like we can just make it through.

00:13:28.810 --> 00:13:32.230
Yeah. Let's keep going
and get this oxygen to the heart.

00:13:35.150 --> 00:13:37.560
It's gonna go! Make a run for it!

00:13:39.440 --> 00:13:40.900
This way!

00:13:49.440 --> 00:13:51.980
N-No...

00:13:54.020 --> 00:13:55.940
A-Are you all right?

00:13:55.940 --> 00:13:57.310
Come on, give me a hand!

00:13:57.310 --> 00:13:58.810
R-Right!

00:14:04.810 --> 00:14:07.310
No good. It's not budging.

00:14:08.310 --> 00:14:11.940
Are you kidding me?
The space to get through...

00:14:11.940 --> 00:14:14.980
It's completely gone!

00:14:15.940 --> 00:14:18.190
Who would've thought?

00:14:18.190 --> 00:14:22.440
To think that the coronary arteries
could get completely clogged like this...

00:14:22.440 --> 00:14:24.730
These symptoms...

00:14:24.730 --> 00:14:27.190
This is a heart attack!

00:14:29.060 --> 00:14:31.560
Who would've thought?

00:14:31.560 --> 00:14:35.600
To think that the coronary arteries
could get completely clogged like this...

00:14:35.600 --> 00:14:37.730
These symptoms...

00:14:37.730 --> 00:14:39.900
This is a heart attack!

00:14:40.770 --> 00:14:42.900
Heart attack.

00:14:42.900 --> 00:14:46.650
A disease that occurs when a blood clot
forms in the coronary arteries,

00:14:46.650 --> 00:14:48.270
obstructing the blood supply

00:14:48.270 --> 00:14:51.730
and destroying the heart muscle.

00:14:51.730 --> 00:14:56.100
Symptoms include prolonged,
severe pain in the front of the chest,

00:14:56.100 --> 00:15:02.690
difficulty in breathing,
arrhythmia, cyanosis and shock.

00:15:03.940 --> 00:15:08.980
At this rate, no oxygen will reach the heart,
and it will become necrotic!

00:15:11.690 --> 00:15:14.730
S-Senpai, what should we do?

00:15:18.480 --> 00:15:20.600
Senpai?

00:15:20.600 --> 00:15:22.560
Grab as much of that oxygen as you can.

00:15:22.560 --> 00:15:23.690
What?

00:15:23.690 --> 00:15:24.650
Hurry!

00:15:24.650 --> 00:15:27.020
O-Okay!

00:15:27.020 --> 00:15:29.980
We have to get there! To the heart!

00:15:29.980 --> 00:15:33.770
If we don't make it,
the heart's gonna stop!

00:15:33.770 --> 00:15:35.690
This body will...

00:15:35.690 --> 00:15:38.810
This body will be done!

00:15:43.230 --> 00:15:45.940
Wh-What the...
Something's going on here!

