00:15:45.940 --> 00:15:47.150
Damn!

00:15:48.190 --> 00:15:50.400
What in the world...

00:15:50.400 --> 00:15:52.730
What in the world is happening?

00:15:54.650 --> 00:15:58.060
So, the time has come at last, huh?

00:15:58.060 --> 00:16:02.400
Actually, I'm surprised it held out this long.

00:16:02.400 --> 00:16:04.400
And now,

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:07.900
we'll have to perform our final task.

00:16:12.270 --> 00:16:15.690
Oh no! The oxygen's about to run out!

00:16:15.690 --> 00:16:19.900
At this rate, the heart will...
We have to do something now!

00:16:22.060 --> 00:16:24.850
Ah, ah...

00:16:24.850 --> 00:16:28.690
All cells in this body, can you hear me?

00:16:28.690 --> 00:16:33.310
We will now hold
an emergency meeting for all cells.

00:16:33.310 --> 00:16:35.600
Emergency meeting?

00:16:35.600 --> 00:16:38.690
This is a first for me, too.

00:16:39.940 --> 00:16:42.440
All of you cells...

00:16:44.650 --> 00:16:49.850
You've done a good job until now,
working for this body.

00:16:49.850 --> 00:16:51.100
However...

00:16:52.270 --> 00:16:55.400
...there is no need for you to carry on.

00:16:56.400 --> 00:16:58.150
Huh?

00:16:58.150 --> 00:17:01.810
What does he mean,
"there's no need for us to work"?

00:17:03.850 --> 00:17:09.690
Just now, a serious incident occurred
within the coronary arteries.

00:17:09.690 --> 00:17:15.650
At this time, the oxygen supply
to the heart has been halted.

00:17:15.650 --> 00:17:17.650
H-Hey! Hold on a second!

00:17:17.650 --> 00:17:21.650
What's going to happen to this body
if the heart stops?

00:17:21.650 --> 00:17:23.230
Smoking and drinking to excess...

00:17:23.230 --> 00:17:24.560
Hot!

00:17:24.560 --> 00:17:29.980
Increased cholesterol levels and stress...

00:17:29.980 --> 00:17:37.480
These factors have led to the numerous threats
this body has been exposed to until now.

00:17:37.480 --> 00:17:45.900
Liver dysfunction, gonococci, spot balding,
kidney stones, urinary tract infection...

00:17:45.900 --> 00:17:49.690
...pulmonary embolism, H. pylori...

00:17:49.690 --> 00:17:54.980
And each time, thanks to your work,
we've managed to overcome those threats.

00:17:54.980 --> 00:17:58.060
But this is the final straw.

00:17:58.060 --> 00:18:04.190
As of today, this body will meet its demise!

00:18:04.190 --> 00:18:06.190
Demise?

00:18:06.190 --> 00:18:08.150
This is the end?

00:18:08.150 --> 00:18:09.770
All of a sudden?

00:18:09.770 --> 00:18:13.400
You really think you can give a speech
like that and we'll just eat it?

00:18:13.400 --> 00:18:16.020
Give us a real explanation!

00:18:16.020 --> 00:18:21.690
O-Of course, we'd anticipate the possibility
of something like this happening eventually.

00:18:21.690 --> 00:18:25.600
But it's not as if we were
concealing it from you.

00:18:25.600 --> 00:18:31.100
There was a good chance that it could've been
averted had the situation improved.

00:18:32.350 --> 00:18:34.650
Liar!

00:18:34.650 --> 00:18:36.190
Don't give us that!

00:18:36.190 --> 00:18:39.940
If you knew all along, wasn't there something
you could've done about it?

00:18:39.940 --> 00:18:44.060
We've taken every possible action on our end...

00:18:44.060 --> 00:18:50.230
...but, uh, this body is now
in an extremely harsh environment.

00:18:50.230 --> 00:18:52.440
You run us all into the ground,
and now you're dumping that on us?

00:18:52.440 --> 00:18:54.650
Is that irresponsible or what?

00:18:56.730 --> 00:18:58.480
Truly...

00:18:58.480 --> 00:19:01.520
We are truly sorry!

00:19:09.980 --> 00:19:11.060
All of you,

00:19:11.060 --> 00:19:13.980
thank you for all your hard work until today.

00:19:15.690 --> 00:19:17.270
Where are you going?

00:19:22.440 --> 00:19:24.190
The heart...

00:19:24.190 --> 00:19:26.440
It stopped?

00:19:26.440 --> 00:19:29.940
Oxygen... Is there any oxygen anywhere?

00:19:29.940 --> 00:19:32.600
You can search all you want,
but you won't find any.

00:19:32.600 --> 00:19:37.150
What about the coronary arteries?
Can't we pass through the coronary arteries yet?

00:19:37.150 --> 00:19:40.600
Not happening. They're still clogged up,
and there's nothing we can do.

00:19:42.100 --> 00:19:44.020
Dammit!

00:19:44.020 --> 00:19:45.150
Senpai?

00:19:45.150 --> 00:19:47.560
As of today...

00:19:47.560 --> 00:19:50.440
...you won't have to work anymore.

00:19:50.440 --> 00:19:55.730
And as for us,
we will take responsibility and...

00:19:58.400 --> 00:19:59.770
What are we supposed to do?

00:19:59.770 --> 00:20:01.650
How should I know?

00:20:03.020 --> 00:20:04.150
Calm down!

00:20:04.150 --> 00:20:06.310
Everyone, carry out your respective roles!

00:20:11.400 --> 00:20:14.600
Th-The body's functions...

00:20:14.600 --> 00:20:17.560
...are coming to a halt!

00:20:17.560 --> 00:20:21.100
There has to be some oxygen!
There has to be some somewhere!

00:20:21.280 --> 00:20:21.490
WELCOME TO THE LUNGS

00:20:22.060 --> 00:20:25.190
W-We're not getting any oxygen!

00:20:25.190 --> 00:20:27.940
H-Has the breathing stopped?

00:20:33.060 --> 00:20:35.770
It's all right. It's going to be all right.

00:20:35.770 --> 00:20:37.850
So, everyone, calm down.

00:20:45.980 --> 00:20:47.310
Dammit!

00:20:47.310 --> 00:20:49.900
Digestion's stopped cold!

00:20:54.230 --> 00:20:57.400
Um, your next order, sir...

00:20:59.400 --> 00:21:02.100
We're waiting for your instructions, sir.

00:21:02.100 --> 00:21:04.600
There's nothing more we can do.

00:21:24.190 --> 00:21:26.980
It's the end of the world!

00:21:29.560 --> 00:21:31.940
Now we can finally rest.

00:21:31.940 --> 00:21:34.810
We don't have to work anymore.

00:21:35.850 --> 00:21:37.440
But that's so...

00:21:37.440 --> 00:21:39.310
...irresponsible!

00:21:39.310 --> 00:21:43.100
Telling us to work one second,
then telling us not to work the next!

00:21:43.100 --> 00:21:44.400
Work...

00:21:44.400 --> 00:21:47.690
Please work, heart!

00:21:51.810 --> 00:21:53.400
I...

00:21:53.400 --> 00:21:55.230
I still...

00:21:57.400 --> 00:21:59.940
...s-still...

